    "instruction": "Create a product sales table in Sheet1. In column A, enter the column header \"Product\" and list four products below it: Pen, Notebook, Folder, and Tape. In column B, enter the column header \"Quantity\" and list their quantities below it: 4, 3, 6, and 2. In column C, enter the column header \"Unit Price\" and list their unit prices below it: 1.5, 4.25, 2.1, and 3.75. Then add a column D with the header \"Line Total\" and calculate each line total by multiplying Quantity by Unit Price.",
